# Scratch output from manually eyeballing rendered cards and from one-off
# probes against the live Steam/Heybox endpoints. The plugin itself writes
# nothing to disk, so none of this is ever produced at runtime; it only exists
# while developing. Kept out of git so a stray `git add -A` cannot pick it up.
/_*.png
/_*.py
/_*.txt
/_*/
